      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KEEP REPEATING\n1. A node is a plain function: state in, changes out\n2. An edge is fixed (add_edge) or chosen by a decision (add_conditional_edges)\n3. interrupt() needs a checkpointer (MemorySaver) to pause and resume",
      "originalText": "KEEP REPEATING\n1. A node is a plain function: state in, changes out\n2. An edge is fixed (add_edge) or chosen by a decision (add_conditional_edges)\n3. interrupt() needs a checkpointer (MemorySaver) to pause and resume",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "key",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
